# @plainworks/{{name}}

> {{{description}}}

Part of the [plainworks](../../README.md) kit.

## Install

```sh
bun add @plainworks/{{name}}
```

## Usage

```ts
import { hello } from "@plainworks/{{name}}"
```
{{#if hasClient}}
Client-only bindings (`"use client"`) live under the `./client` entry:

```ts
